hp":20000,"atk":1000,"def":100,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"fortbreaker_enemy_10123_uareap":{"slug":"fortbreaker_enemy_10123_uareap","name":"Fortbreaker","icon":"/enemies-icons/Fortbreaker.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"War machine developed by the First Arsenal of Ursus, representing the cutting-edge of Ursus's military technology. Only used in important battles due to massive energy requirements.","abilities":["Can only be blocked by units with at least 3 Block; can fight 3 <Miner Guerrillas> at a time","Fires several rockets, dealing AoE damage","Fires more rockets when under a commander's orders"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":25000,"atk":800,"def":1300,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"rampaging_abnormal_manglerbeast":{"slug":"rampaging_abnormal_manglerbeast","name":"Rampaging Abnormal Manglerbeast","icon":"/enemies-icons/Rampaging Abnormal Manglerbeast.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Infected Creature","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Has long lost its divinity. Only its survival instinct keeps it going.","abilities":["First Form","Attacks hit twice and greatly increase the damage the target takes from this unit","Enraged. Attacks both friend and foe, and seeks out units that have dealt damage to it; Physical and Arts damage taken greatly reduced, ASPD and Movement Speed greatly increased","Loses rage and attempts to flee after some time, or if HP drops below a certain level","Second Form","Reappears after a short delay, remaining enraged for a while; during this time, Physical and Arts damage taken is greatly reduced, while ATK is greatly increased","Attacks all nearby allied units","[Rockfall] Deals Physical damage to the unit that has dealt the most damage to it, inflicting Stun"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":150000,"atk":1000,"def":300,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"shadow_scholar":{"slug":"shadow_scholar","name":"Shadow Scholar","icon":"/enemies-icons/Shadow Scholar.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A character often seen in Yanese shadow plays, prone to strange encounters in those plays. This Shadowgeist has seen these scenes play out so many times that it believes them to be real, and even warning of the talismans is not enough to dissuade it.","abilities":["When HP drops below a certain level, absorbs a nearby <Talisman> and recovers HP"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":13000,"atk":350,"def":50,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2}},"guerrilla_herald_leader":{"slug":"guerrilla_herald_leader","name":"Guerrilla Herald Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Guerrilla Herald Leader.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Compared to regular heralds, these leaders have greater individual combat capabilities. The heralds are important links within their communication system. While present, they will issue tactical commands to increase the offensive and defensive abilities of nearby allies.","abilities":["Increases the ATK and DEF of enemy units when on the battlefield."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":360,"def":120,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"talisman":{"slug":"talisman","name":"Talisman","icon":"/enemies-icons/Talisman.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":